        <UserObject label="&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Modelo Entidade Relacionamento&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;O ato de incluir é o registro do consumo diário.&lt;/b&gt; Ele consiste em salvar uma nova linha na tabela &lt;code data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;97&quot;&gt;refeicao_usuario&lt;/code&gt; que conecta exatamente quatro informações:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul data-path-to-node=&quot;2&quot;&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Quem:&lt;/b&gt; o usuário que está comendo.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Quando:&lt;/b&gt; a refeição do dia (tabela fixa, como Café ou Almoço).&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;O que:&lt;/b&gt; o alimento consumido.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-path-to-node=&quot;2,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Quanto:&lt;/b&gt; a quantidade ingerida.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" placeholders="1" name="Variable" id="uLykUMAXghqICl-jtlEf-15">
